  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 outperforms PCA in singleprofile (config_004 vs config_001) and multiprofile settings (config_005). However, uncertainty remains about whether scgpt (a more complex encoder) could further improve performance in multiprofile settings. Testing config_008 isolates the effect of the RNA encoder (scgpt vs scvi_n200) while keeping multiprofile and avgpool aggregation consistent, directly comparing encoder impact. This addresses critical uncertainty about whether advanced encoders like scgpt provide additional benefits beyond scvi_n200 in multiprofile configurations."
